{"id":"1a02ada6-17ac-4492-b05a-55760137995d","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"458a03ca66793978","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/node-modules-provider.ts","baseline":{"blob":"7d4eda06ca0a4664d20c5d33a635ce4156142c08","start":2256,"end":2860},"shape":{"type":"FunctionDeclaration","atoms":["function","childEntries","(","meta",":","UnpkgMeta",")",":","[","string",",","FileType","]","[]","{","if","(","meta",".","type","===","\"","directory","\"",")","{","return","(","meta",".","files","??","[","]",")",".","map","(","(","entry",")","=>","[","entry",".","path",".","split","(","\"","/","\"",")",".","filter","(","Boolean",")",".","pop","(",")","??","\"","","\"",",","entry",".","type","===","\"","directory","\"","?","FileType",".","Directory",":","FileType",".","File","]",")",";","}","const","children","=","new","Map","<","string",",","FileType",">","(",")",";","for","(","const","entry","of","meta",".","files","??","[","]",")","{","const","[","name",",","...","deeper","]","=","entry",".","path",".","slice","(","(","meta",".","prefix","??","\"","/","\"",")",".","length",")",".","split","(","\"","/","\"",")",".","filter","(","Boolean",")",";","if","(","name","!==","undefined",")","{","children",".","set","(","name",",","deeper",".","length",">","0","?","FileType",".","Directory",":","FileType",".","File",")",";","}","}","return","[","...","children","]",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"2dc1be590869fd46","after":"f070f66f63c14973"}},"payload":{"text":"A directory's immediate children from either `?meta` shape; in the flat one, a deeper path means a subdirectory.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:52:38.898Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:52:38.898Z"}
{"id":"25b4d6c4-0850-4a53-b182-6d639a160859","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"545de4de826eecf5","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/node-modules-provider.ts","baseline":{"blob":"4bd957b8429eac02e772be0be9b9ef3078303af5","start":0,"end":128},"shape":{"type":"ImportDeclaration","atoms":["import","type","{","IFileChange",",","IFileSystemProviderWithFileReadWriteCapability",",","IStat","}","from","\"","@brianjenkins94/monaco-vscode-api/main","\""]},"context":{"after":"5d6cde6b15360caa"}},"payload":{"text":"CDN-backed, read-only, *eventually-consistent* filesystem provider for node_modules.\n\nThe other half of the resolution stack: the synchronous snapshot (build/package-types.ts → editorTypesPlugin)\nseeds the .d.ts surface the TS type-checker needs up front; this overlay lazily fetches FULL package\nsource from unpkg on demand so go-to-definition / hover reaches the real implementation (and\ntransitive deps) without baking any of it into the page. It works in a static deploy (no filesystem).\n\nRegistered as a low-priority `file` overlay: it only answers `<workspaceFolder>/node_modules/<pkg>/…`\nand throws FileNotFound otherwise, so the in-memory snapshot wins for everything else (the overlay\nfalls through on FileNotFound). Built from primitives re-exported by\n`@brianjenkins94/monaco-vscode-api/main` so editor doesn't depend on @codingame packages directly.\n\nNote: this satisfies go-to-definition/browsing into CDN deps, but NOT the TS type-checker, which\nresolves package.json/exports against a synchronous worker view the async provider can't populate —\ntype-checked source imports must be seeded synchronously instead (editorTypesPlugin).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:52:46.629Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:52:46.629Z"}
{"id":"2d194a2b-3dfa-4ab7-a1e9-b6f36eba9c9d","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"d10619e7f834763b","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/node-modules-provider.ts","baseline":{"blob":"05f15b8de4c194e5c42855e1fc5482b5779405c0","start":14037,"end":15064},"shape":{"type":"Property","atoms":["\"","stat","\"",":","function","(","resource",")",":","Promise","<","IStat",">","{","const","rel","=","toRel","(","resource",".","path",")",";","if","(","rel","===","undefined",")","{","return","Promise",".","reject","(","notFound","(",")",")",";","}","if","(","rel","===","\"","","\"",")","{","return","Promise",".","resolve","(","{","\"","type","\"",":","FileType",".","Directory",",","\"","ctime","\"",":","0",",","\"","mtime","\"",":","0",",","\"","size","\"",":","0","}",")",";","}","if","(","isTsSourceProbe","(","rel",")",")","{","return","Promise",".","reject","(","notFound","(",")",")",";","}","if","(","folders",".","has","(","rel",")",")","{","return","Promise",".","resolve","(","{","\"","type","\"",":","FileType",".","Directory",",","\"","ctime","\"",":","0",",","\"","mtime","\"",":","0",",","\"","size","\"",":","0","}",")",";","}","if","(","absent","(","rel",")",")","{","return","Promise",".","reject","(","notFound","(",")",")",";","}","if","(","!","fileResults",".","has","(","rel",")",")","{","ensureFile","(","rel",",","resource",")",";","return","Promise",".","reject","(","notFound","(",")",")",";","}","const","statData","=","fileResults",".","get","(","rel",")",";","if","(","statData","===","undefined",")","{","return","Promise",".","reject","(","notFound","(",")",")",";","}","return","Promise",".","resolve","(","{","\"","type","\"",":","FileType",".","File",",","\"","ctime","\"",":","0",",","\"","mtime","\"",":","0",",","\"","size","\"",":","statData",".","length","}",")",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"57f17d981d414f06","after":"6e6f0cb5d3a51945"}},"payload":{"text":"All three reads are SYNCHRONOUS-SAFE: they answer from the resolved cache or fail fast (never awaiting a\nfetch), so the sync-api checker can't deadlock on them. A miss kicks off the background fetch, which\ncaches + announces; the checker re-reads on that change and resolves.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:51:26.515Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:51:26.515Z"}
