{"id":"5305213b-eb58-4c70-a7d5-d4fb3ba1fc90","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"03d7a2a7b0e21169","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/node-modules-provider.ts","baseline":{"blob":"e9632d022d90eb4daa9d650c87e167208de56677","start":1864,"end":1873},"shape":{"type":"Keyword","atoms":["interface"]},"context":{"before":"fca719093f154325","after":"81ea6f941ed58fcd#0"}},"payload":{"text":"unpkg `?meta`: the old listing (`type: \"directory\"`, its immediate `files`), or the current one — `{ prefix, files }`\nwith every file beneath the prefix flat, by full path (`type` is then a MIME type, and directories aren't listed).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:52:42.780Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:52:42.780Z"}
{"id":"64bd8a0c-a738-430e-9af6-a50c6ef6bf54","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"f070f66f63c14973","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/node-modules-provider.ts","baseline":{"blob":"b50eda0c30a36e6f962c98bb411ed2da4981f538","start":2982,"end":3116},"shape":{"type":"FunctionDeclaration","atoms":["function","isTsSourceProbe","(","rel",":","string",")",":","boolean","{","return","(","/","\\.(?:tsx?|mts|cts)$","/","u",")",".","test","(","rel",")","&&","!","(","/","\\.d\\.(?:ts|mts|cts)$","/","u",")",".","test","(","rel",")",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"458a03ca66793978","after":"4b5a656074b851d8"}},"payload":{"text":"A spurious TypeScript-SOURCE probe: `.ts`/`.tsx`/`.mts`/`.cts` that is NOT a declaration (`.d.ts` …).\nPublished packages never ship `.ts` source; tsserver probes `<pkg>/index.ts` before `.d.ts`, and the CDN\nanswers those with content (a redirect to the real file), which tsserver then RESOLVES the import to\n(\"is not a module\") — shadowing the @types surface. Serving them notFound keeps the probe a failed lookup.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:52:35.129Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:52:35.129Z"}
{"id":"6e61d1df-a4a8-4712-9806-b7691322117d","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"57f17d981d414f06","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/node-modules-provider.ts","baseline":{"blob":"3dcc8ab80c9fb5e330dadb31cbda1a60c0a53732","start":13938,"end":13987},"shape":{"type":"ObjectElement","atoms":["\"","watch","\"",":","(",")","=>","(","{","\"","dispose","\"",":","function","(",")","{","}","}",")",","]},"context":{"before":"d65319d1bf8242fc","after":"35d428dcc1744840"}},"payload":{"text":"nothing is watched — nothing to dispose","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:51:31.759Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:51:31.759Z"}
{"id":"70ae7984-c13f-470c-a7b4-d7071f92a478","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"b4f7c68cbb0f0bd1","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/node-modules-provider.ts","baseline":{"blob":"377ece036ea1bb5c687433a656750f1dfcf2bc0b","start":9115,"end":9146},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","whole","=","new","Set","<","string",">","(",")"]},"context":{"before":"1f3f36ffe4cf4a8f","after":"03bd5bb233a2316d"}},"payload":{"text":"Packages read whole, ahead of what asks (prefetch): their files in fileResults, and each folder's children here, so\nwhat reads them as Node reads a disk (ESLint's worker loading a config) has them at its first read, a folder's\nlisting too, which the CDN only gives by a fetch of its own. A path in one that isn't in it is nowhere: no fetch.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:51:48.230Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:51:48.230Z"}
{"id":"70b375b4-5ae1-463e-ad4e-4847bf4314e5","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"0e65f7bea2e18864","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/node-modules-provider.ts","baseline":{"blob":"d8bc2e045734cfe668061dc90bdf4b4aa171c2a6","start":5423,"end":5509},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","served","=","(","rel",":","string",")",":","boolean","=>","versions","[","splitPackage","(","rel",")",".","pkg","]","!==","undefined"]},"context":{"before":"72405fc5d94c8bbe","after":"d9e6b1b3c95c4fad"}},"payload":{"text":"Only packages with a pinned version are served. The CDN 302-redirects every *unversioned* request\n(e.g. `unpkg.com/preact` → `…/preact@10.x`); the resolver's CDN fallback follows that redirect\ninternally (its fetch isn't bound by the document's COEP), but we still can't pin a version\nsynchronously, so we simply don't fetch unpinned packages (type-checking uses the synchronous\nsnapshot, not this provider).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:52:11.948Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:52:11.948Z"}
{"id":"957bddac-b8ae-4334-8cca-7ab28c81e96f","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"a088b7aea5ed747d","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/node-modules-provider.ts","baseline":{"blob":"72521f9ce25888caa99f8f0a5c7fc4c082873515","start":17008,"end":17080},"shape":{"type":"If","atoms":["if","(","children",".","length","===","0",")","{","return","Promise",".","reject","(","notFound","(",")",")",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"c81300b854313a72","after":"785937b9aecfe81d"}},"payload":{"text":"unpkg answers `?meta` for ANY path (see stat), so an empty listing is a file or nothing — not a directory.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:51:16.850Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:51:16.850Z"}
{"id":"a045dc70-4ef7-4a77-b05a-dbe30390e6f1","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"00b01fad035dd5ba","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/node-modules-provider.ts","baseline":{"blob":"2051f22834c0d31c01c689196a19b18ea9ea9066","start":3696,"end":3780},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","IMPORT_TRIES","=","[","\"","","\"",",","\"",".js","\"",",","\"",".mjs","\"",",","\"",".cjs","\"",",","\"",".ts","\"",",","\"",".mts","\"",",","\"",".cts","\"",",","\"","/index.js","\"","]"]},"context":{"before":"4b5a656074b851d8","after":"485bb3908b5bd9f4"}},"payload":{"text":"What a relative import may name, a file as written or with Node's extensions.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:52:27.314Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:52:27.314Z"}
